        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "Complete the Archon Quest \"A New Star Approaches\" and reach Friendship 1/3/5 to launch Linnea's Naturalist Archive Completion Project. Do note that you must complete all special lectures in the previous category before proceeding to the next category."
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/04/11/237301566/b6f88efb1bbff0d7e5cf77dc153ea6e1_4573307786774365225.png",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "Each category's completion plan includes four regular investigation tasks and one special lecture. Completing all investigation tasks within that category will unlock the special lecture."
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/04/11/237301566/852af1b51c2d3d50dd44844c4866cace_5437375725926577914.png",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "Upon completing the special lectures, you will receive cosmetic rewards. In the badge combination interface, you can change your cosmetic backpack badge and choose whether the backpack is exclusive or shared."
      },
